{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > Dodge-Riot-Dodge-Em-1980-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212610/plan.md <<'EOF'\n# Dodge Riot implementation plan\n\nOriginal arcade lane chase inspired by Dodge Em (1980), from native knowledge only.\nThree rounds, four rounded rectangular lanes with four interchange gates, collectible fare dots,\noncoming rivals, rechargeable boost, brake, shields, near-miss combo, shared-life co-op.\nOrthographic 3D cel/ink scene, native Three animation mixer for cars and scenery.\nSingle HTML bundle with pinned external Three.js 0.180.0 / Rapier 0.19.3 dependencies.\nKeyboard, standard gamepads, assisted invisible touch controls, pause/settings/dev/about.\nAttract demonstration after ten seconds. Hub shared-world host-authoritative snapshots plus\nstandalone local co-op and direct WebRTC rooms. Procedural Web Audio only.\nVerify simulation, controls, complete run, UI, touch, audio, networking, and visuals.\nEOF\ncurl -L --fail --silent --show-error https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/build/three.webgpu.js -o Dodge-Riot-Dodge-Em-1980-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212610/three-api.js\ncurl -L --fail --silent --show-error https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat@0.19.3/rapier.es.js -o Dodge-Riot-Dodge-Em-1980-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212610/rapier-api.js\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
