{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The core simulation is working with Rapier sensors for pickups and car collisions. Independent tests have already driven the attract AI through all three rounds. Testing also caught a boost exploit that could repeatedly refresh collision immunity; I’m fixing that before finishing the controls and menus.\n"}}
