ments and explicit automated-testing stand-ins.\\\",\n    \\\"The no-research rule and required online integration URL needed a distinction between research and fetching integration files.\\\",\n    \\\"Delivering a complete three-round arcade loop with local, direct-peer and AI Hub co-op in one shareable HTML file.\\\",\n    \\\"Specify whether standalone online co-op should use a hosted room service or manual peer connection codes.\\\"\n  ],\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dodge Riot\\\",\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Four lanes. A full tank of trouble.\\\",\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Sweep four nested circuits, slip past oncoming rivals and zip your way into the motor club. Three escalating arcade rounds for a solo driver or a cooperative pair.\\\",\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Racing\\\",\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Dodge Em (1980)\\\",\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"\\\",\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–2\\\",\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"P1: arrows / A D steer, Space / W zip, Down / S brake; local P2: A D steer, W zip, S brake; pad: D-pad / stick steer, R2 zip, L2 brake, Options pause; touch: left thumb steer, right ZIP button.\\\",\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"arcade\\\", \\\"top-down\\\", \\\"co-op\\\", \\\"retro\\\", \\\"vehicles\\\"]\n  }\n}\nEOF\nnode Dodge-Riot-Dodge-Em-1980-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212610/build.mjs\nnode Dodge-Riot-Dodge-Em-1980-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212610/sim-tests.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
